{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年37歲的歌手譚嘉儀向來身材出眾。日前，她在社交平台大派福利，上載了多張性感靚相。相中的她換上一身三點式泳裝，更因泳褲剪裁極度迷你，轉身時漏出屁股蛋，火辣指數直線飆升。</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀身穿三點式泳裝。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207058953572352863052.jpeg/SykTY-iKEHrkmkyAybATD2HXxJdE_mWAO7AjWTuwI1k\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀身穿三點式泳裝。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><p>激罕大解放換上三點式</p><p>身處泳池派對的譚嘉儀，頂着一頭招牌吸睛金髮，身穿一套設計性感的三點式泳衣。她手持雞尾酒對着鏡頭甜笑，擺出多個誘人姿勢，大騷豐滿上圍與纖細腰身。</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀大曬好身材！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207055786741760876093.jpeg/N1YvSIde9E-KawVjZZnEsfjYPZTI1vSSrW057q1tOe4\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀大曬好身材！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀手持雞尾酒對着鏡頭甜笑。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207050057060352891762.jpeg/Azrf3J1BveN9K-dVKHvoHBbYShTVDGAA2jFA2NoxQNg\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀手持雞尾酒對着鏡頭甜笑。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身材火辣！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207084580769792014367.jpeg/kYlpCCO3zrXoMAuvKPwK9EUrN3fWJG6yt5sPrbebD60\"/><figcaption>身材火辣！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><p>轉身邁步驚現蜜桃臀</p><p>除了大曬性感靚相之外，譚嘉儀還上載了一段短片。片中她轉身走向泳池，當她背對鏡頭、跟隨音樂向前邁步時，其下半身的剪裁極度惹火。超迷你的三角泳褲隨着她的走動，半邊屁股蛋直接外露，渾圓的臀部線條與逆天美腿一覽無遺，背影殺傷力驚人。</p><figure><img alt=\"泳池派對（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207076934160384914265.png/CFzFQiN1HaLJjP-iX1avCKbe4yhgra21ruvdeq7r3Xo\"/><figcaption>泳池派對（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀身穿超迷你的三角泳褲。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207082248605696397016.png/qZ9oh6rHJiA3OepPCn5EVsJLTuWQ61v8lbZOv5W2Tr8\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀身穿超迷你的三角泳褲。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靚人靚景！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207079438290944183290.png/6X2CDsKtCHQEP0NR_YGMCkCOv-A08wpPuwUvJrsFLyY\"/><figcaption>靚人靚景！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀不時在IG大曬性感照。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207052875763712946138.jpeg/WsyzRzxnMGe9KgNLLnwt3SqH12hsiJfqqAnfP6gJ3z8\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀不時在IG大曬性感照。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀不時周遊列國。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207087286226944916423.jpeg/6ngH3DsH9cnH0N3EVoVaTjA1rWub2hAVBxCiZQcQomU\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀不時周遊列國。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T05:42:21.986649+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":495,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}